{"title": "Trumps of Doom", "pageid": 2060, "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 210px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/princeofamber/images/e/ed/Trumps_of_Doom.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20100806151204\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"1 of many book covers of the book Trumps of Doom\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/princeofamber/images/e/ed/Trumps_of_Doom.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/210?cb=20100806151204\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"210\" height=\"310\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Trumps of Doom.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Trumps_of_Doom.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Trumps_of_Doom.jpg\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">1 of many book covers of the book Trumps of Doom</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p><b>Trumps of Doom</b> is the first book in the second Chronicles of <a href=\"/wiki/Yander\" title=\"Yander\">Yander</a> series by Roger Zelazny; and the sixth book overall. Whereas the first series was narrated by <a href=\"/wiki/Pavel\" title=\"Pavel\">Pavel</a>, this series is narrated by his son, <a href=\"/wiki/Moorlin\" title=\"Moorlin\">Moorlin</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Plot_Summary\">Plot Summary</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fprinceofamber.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FTrumps_of_Doom%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In an effort to understand his father Pavel better, Moorlin has spent the last several years on the shadow Earth learning computer science while attending Berkley. During this time Moorlin built a trump and <a href=\"/wiki/The_Pattern\" title=\"The Pattern\">Pattern</a> based computer, called <a href=\"/wiki/Spiritcircle\" title=\"Spiritcircle\">Spiritcircle</a>, in a far off <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow\" title=\"Shadow\">Shadow</a>. Having completed his project, he wishes to know who has been trying to kill him every April 30 before he leaves. He meets with his friend Lucas Reynard (<a href=\"/wiki/Mark\" title=\"Mark\">Mark</a>), a salesman and longtime friend, who tries to convince him to stay. Mark mentions he has recently seen <a href=\"/wiki/Roberta\" title=\"Roberta\">Roberta</a>, Moorlin's ex-girlfriend, and gives Moorlin a mysterious letter. Moorlin investigates and finds Roberta slain by creatures from another shadow.\n</p><p>Moorlin investigates through shadow, and is given orders by king Random to shut down Spiritcircle. However, Spiritcircle has become sentient and capable of defending itself. Eventually, Mark - who, it turns out, is <a href=\"/wiki/Jon\" title=\"Jon\">Jon's</a> son - imprisons Moorlin in a blue crystal cave so he can attempt to take control of Spiritcircle for himself. master of shadow 01:31, August 6, 2010 (UTC)\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260429224610\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.010 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.016 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 6/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.1_prod_princeofamber:pcache:idhash:2060-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260429224610 and revision id 4474. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>", "sections": [{"toclevel": 1, "level": "2", "line": "Plot Summary", "number": "1", "index": "1", "fromtitle": "Trumps_of_Doom", "byteoffset": 320, "anchor": "Plot_Summary", "linkAnchor": "Plot_Summary"}], "links": [{"ns": 0, "title": "Yander", "exists": true}, {"ns": 0, "title": "Jon", "exists": true}, {"ns": 0, "title": "Pavel", "exists": true}, {"ns": 0, "title": "Spiritcircle", "exists": true}, {"ns": 0, "title": "Roberta", "exists": true}, {"ns": 0, "title": "Mark", "exists": true}, {"ns": 0, "title": "Moorlin", "exists": true}, {"ns": 0, "title": "Shadow", "exists": true}, {"ns": 0, "title": "The Pattern", "exists": true}], "url": "https://amber.fandom.com/ru/wiki/Trumps_of_Doom"}